# Force LF line endings for text files in the working tree.
# Without this, Git for Windows checks text files out as CRLF, which inflates
# multi-line CSV cell lengths (one extra \r per embedded newline) and makes the
# 500-char validator in scripts/wallet-schema.mjs (and import-update.mjs) fail
# locally on Windows even though the data is valid. CI runs on Linux (LF) and was
# unaffected — this keeps local and CI behaviour consistent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never apply line-ending conversion.
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
